/target
# The Ice test runner writes per-test artifacts under a crate's own target dir.
**/target/
/.worktree/
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees/
.codex/worktrees/
# Brainstorm specs and implementation plans are per-PR working files, never a
# record: they stay local and die with their worktree.
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/

# Session handoff notes — local working state, never committed.
HANDOFF.md

# Key material a node or wallet writes (identity.key, user.key) never enters
# the tree, wherever a command was run from.
*.key
